cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  pystaple is a Python translation of the STAPLE toolbox. If you use it, please
  cite the STAPLE publication (preferred citation below) and the publications of
  the algorithms you use (see README.md).
title: "pystaple: Python port of the STAPLE toolbox"
